  "message": "Why is my VPN failing, and what should I try?",
  "outcome": "success",
  "reply": "**Finding:** VPN service is degraded. The status tool reports: “Northstar VPN gateway is rejecting new sessions (ns-vpn-degraded).”\n\n**Likely cause:** The gateway’s rejection of new sessions can explain the user’s connection failure. There is not enough evidence to identify an additional client-side cause.\n\n**Recommended next step:** Wait until the gateway reports that it is accepting new sessions, then reconnect. Do not reset the user’s password.",
